    "spans": [
     {
      "end": 542,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Dan (son of Jacob)\nAccording to the Book of Genesis , Dan ( Hebrew : \u05d3\u05b8\u05bc\u05df , Dan D\u0101n ; `` judgment '' or `` he judged '' ) was the fifth son of Jacob with Bilhah . He was Bilhah 's first son . He was the founder of the Israelite Tribe of Dan . In the biblical account , Dan 's mother is described as Rachel 's handmaid , who becomes one of Jacob 's wives . According to the Book of Jubilees , Dan was born on 9 of 1915 . He is also Rey 's stepson , Elul . He was the father of Hushim , according to Gen 46:23 . Samson was a descendant of Dan ."
     }
    ],
    "status": "ok"
   },
