      "end": 412,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Dan Parent\nDan Parent ( born 1964 ) is an American comic book artist and writer best known for his work for Archie Comics . A graduate of The Kubert School , Parent began working for Archie immediately after graduation . His writing of the Love Showdown series from 1994 received widespread attention . Parent has also illustrated Felix the Cat , Barbie , Disney Adventures , and a wide variety of other titles ."
